{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"53cdca78226e8526","type":"text","text":"Obsessive nerd. Really into some obscure science.","x":-440,"y":-80,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"f0305ddf8d575648","type":"text","text":"You stay and chat. You're into it. It gets late and you stay in the spare room. In the morning you help out behind the bar. You fall for the barperson and just end up staying. You never find out what the deal is with the manor.","x":-860,"y":1020,"width":250,"height":280},
		{"id":"aa334c5f37a38cde","type":"text","text":"Learn nothing. Get a bit pissed.\n\nManor.\n\n\n\n\n","x":180,"y":720,"width":250,"height":301},
		{"id":"bbfb3e308071bb19","type":"text","text":"Tells you that there's something weird at the manor, be careful - the posh people up there are hot, but probably evil. ","x":-250,"y":780,"width":250,"height":170},
		{"id":"45cfd9cde10f0498","type":"text","text":"Manor \n\nBig sppoky\n\nfraternal twins?\n\nSister\nBrother\nCook","x":-200,"y":1380,"width":250,"height":260},
		{"id":"71678427c8abff57","type":"text","text":"Fuck this. Go back to the pub. ","x":840,"y":1870,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"fcbaee74a7d3fe29","type":"text","text":"Driven mad by witnessing the experiements.","x":590,"y":2520,"width":250,"height":100},
		{"id":"6198360000b28888","type":"text","text":"Experiment.","x":325,"y":2220,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"50b1bef17ba4a4b9","type":"text","text":"They do unexplained experiments that produce lights and sounds from the manor. ","x":800,"y":365,"width":250,"height":110},
		{"id":"a21273aacf0dbe47","type":"text","text":"Coming to a manor. Spooky.\n\nWho are you?","x":-125,"y":-480,"width":250,"height":100},
		{"id":"2cb32045d90d1abd","type":"text","text":"Refined. A normal amount of scared. Probably hot.","x":-125,"y":-240,"width":250,"height":50},
		{"id":"5ef17bd8e7c13c7a","type":"text","text":"Haunted. Hot but have nerves or something.","x":240,"y":-215,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"89be93d00e59d517","type":"text","text":"You see creepy lights in the dark.\n\nGo back to the pub?\n\nWalk towards the lights.","x":1320,"y":919,"width":250,"height":205},
		{"id":"af1f7b2035270bac","type":"text","text":"There's also a waif like chick who everyone loves but is super eery. The stable boy loves her but its never gonna happen.","x":465,"y":285,"width":250,"height":160},
		{"id":"b06e5ebc46ac8215","type":"text","text":"Stable.\n\nAsk about the manor?\n\n\nPress for more info on the sister\n\nPub?\n\nManor?","x":520,"y":740,"width":250,"height":300},
		{"id":"ab5859a04f731c32","type":"text","text":"Press about sister.\nHe dies of a brokem heart.\nYou just inadvertently murdered a man.\n\nJust fucking leave.\n\nHead to the manor\n\n","x":925,"y":1245,"width":250,"height":320},
		{"id":"1a165239633bbf0d","type":"text","text":"Fall down a pit and die.","x":1320,"y":1650,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"aa0c178e7329e328","type":"text","text":"Leave scared and disorientated. ","x":520,"y":1180,"width":250,"height":130},
		{"id":"0106aac04dc670c9","type":"text","text":"You just fucking leave. This isn't worth it.","x":305,"y":1535,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"521c916a381c20b9","type":"text","text":"Sister\n\nPale and creepy\n\nStand still ","x":-860,"y":1750,"width":250,"height":210},
		{"id":"0b7588522a6edd9b","type":"text","text":"Brother\n\nstarts talking to you about weird stuff.\n\nFollow him\n\nStand stock still","x":-520,"y":1660,"width":250,"height":300},
		{"id":"c4166d8a004f468e","type":"text","text":"Creepy room of paintings\n\nTunnel?\n\nGo back to the corridor\\?\n","x":-985,"y":2480,"width":250,"height":180},
		{"id":"04018c5d8659419c","type":"text","text":"Agree\n\nDisagree","x":-680,"y":2080,"width":250,"height":140},
		{"id":"f39fcf295359be9a","type":"text","text":"Cook. Get out of here you idiot.\n\nFuck this go back to the pub.\n\nJust leave.\n\nIgnore warning and follow \n\nSister\n\nBrother","x":50,"y":1720,"width":250,"height":360},
		{"id":"948c887547e0b77a","type":"text","text":"You love it here now","x":640,"y":3240,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"c0a7a227fefea582","type":"text","text":"Asks you to prove your love\n\nAgree \n\nDisagree\n\n\n\n","x":-684,"y":3190,"width":250,"height":170},
		{"id":"4f4b32ecc57a37c4","type":"text","text":"Trapped in the walls forever.","x":-735,"y":3520,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"5f44184497c8eae6","type":"text","text":"Fall in love","x":13,"y":3440,"width":325,"height":60},
		{"id":"f35d81cb9f8e0832","type":"text","text":"Tunnel\n\nLreft?\n\nRight?\n\n","x":-680,"y":2825,"width":250,"height":210},
		{"id":"0d0e4be7ea77da03","type":"text","text":"Corridor\n\nDoor 1?\nDoor 2?","x":50,"y":2470,"width":250,"height":150},
		{"id":"123dfbcd88fbfdfe","type":"text","text":"Forces you to watch the experiment","x":-520,"y":2380,"width":335,"height":90},
		{"id":"58f76539b1bb07f1","x":715,"y":-540,"width":250,"height":260,"type":"text","text":"\nthe house knows me\nthe sister is a ghost\nThe painting is of you"},
		{"id":"6705251af2d1ed00","type":"text","text":"Arrive in the village first. It's night, its raining. Small village, rurual. \n\nPub?\nManor?\nStable?\n","x":180,"y":40,"width":250,"height":200},
		{"id":"d1a375a273c75d6e","type":"text","text":"Pub. Check out the clientele. They're not into you at all.\n\nSay something inadvertently insulting about the barperson?\n\nAct humble and buy a shit pint?\n\nAsk why the village is so spooky?\n\nFlirt with the barperson.","x":-485,"y":170,"width":250,"height":390},
		{"id":"a1263e336e38874d","type":"text","text":"They're is weirdly into it. Tells you that there's something weird at the manor, be careful - the posh people up there are hot, but probably evil. \n\nGo to the manor?\nStay and get to know the bar person?","x":-640,"y":670,"width":250,"height":280}
	],
